# Lighthouse JSON reports, written by `yarn workspace @wallet/web lighthouse`.
# Kept on disk because they are what a failed budget is diagnosed from, and CI
# uploads them as an artifact; never committed, because they are a measurement
# of one machine at one moment.
lighthouse-report/

# Generated symlinks into .agents/skills, pointing at absolute paths on one
# machine. `core.symlinks` is false on Windows, so git would commit them as text
# files containing someone else's home directory. The skills themselves are
# tracked in .agents/; restore the links with `npx skills experimental_install`.
.claude/skills/

.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

